        "assertion": "Three surfaces are explicitly retained and still work: the TaskRecord v3 read path in runtime/kernel/types.ts, validation.ts, and storage.ts, because real v3 audit records exist on disk and readAuditTaskPair would throw without it; runtime/kernel/legacy_audit.ts, the live reader behind `imm-kernel audit --legacy`; and runtime/kernel/storage_layout_migration.ts, whose retirement depends on external repositories.",
        "verification": "{\n  \"contract\": \"assurance_kernel/verification_descriptor/v1\",\n  \"runner_id\": \"bun\",\n  \"runner_version\": \"1.4.2\",\n  \"argv\": [\n    \"test\",\n    \"tests/kernel-record-v3.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/v4-storage-retirement-legacy-audit.test.ts\",\n    \"tests/kernel-storage-layout-migration.test.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"cwd\": \".\",\n  \"timeout_ms\": 120000,\n  \"max_output_bytes\": 20000\n}\n"
